  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: stack buffer overflow when a bz2 decompressor is reused\n     after a decompression error\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-9669.patch: record the libbz2 error in\n       BZ2FileObject and BZ2DecompObject in Modules/bz2module.c, route every\n       read through a Util_BzRead() wrapper that reports the recorded error\n       instead of re-entering the errored stream, and reject a reused\n       BZ2Decompressor.decompress() with ValueError\n     - CVE-2026-9669",
